{"3989000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Battleship 2", "steam_appid": 3989000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The naval war rages on in Dualbooted’s sequel to the classic battleship game!</strong> Step back onto the deck and face new challenges while keeping the gameplay you know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the familiar <strong>Classic Mode</strong>, or test yourself in two new modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship Defence</strong> – guard an allied vessel for as long as you can against endless enemy attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mayday</strong> – protect a damaged ship as it struggles to repair itself. If it’s restored, move on to save another, and another, until you’re overwhelmed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles, upgrade your ship with new parts or purchase entirely new vessels to match your style. Face shifting weather conditions that change the fight and force you to adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sea is unforgiving. <strong>How long can you last?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The naval war rages on in Dualbooted’s sequel to the classic battleship game!</strong> Step back onto the deck and face new challenges while keeping the gameplay you know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the familiar <strong>Classic Mode</strong>, or test yourself in two new modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship Defence</strong> – guard an allied vessel for as long as you can against endless enemy attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mayday</strong> – protect a damaged ship as it struggles to repair itself. If it’s restored, move on to save another, and another, until you’re overwhelmed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles, upgrade your ship with new parts or purchase entirely new ve